# EdminBoost Project Rules

WordPress admin productivity plugin. PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.0+, GPL-3.0.

See `edminboost-standards.mdc` (quality), `edminboost-compliance.mdc` (security gate), `edminboost-features.mdc` (feature modules), `edminboost-command-center.mdc` (Command Center UI), `edminboost-qa.mdc` (PHPUnit + Playwright).

