## Architecture

- Bootstrap defines constants, optionally requires `includes/pro/edminboost-premium.php`, requires core classes (including `EDMINBOOST_Plan`), registers activation/deactivation hooks, and calls `edminboost_run_plugin()`. When `EDMINBOOST_Plan::is_direct_build()`, `edminboost_run_plugin()` requires `includes/pro/edminboost-pro-package.php` before constructing `EDMINBOOST_Plugin`.
- Bootstrap filename equals `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG . '.php'` (`edminboost-admin-customization.php`).
- `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG` is the canonical plugin slug (folder + bootstrap filename). `EDMINBOOST_TEXT_DOMAIN` matches the slug (plugin header / WordPress.org Plugin Check).
- `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()` wires admin menu/settings/assets, and `EDMINBOOST_Features::register_hooks()` on `admin_init`. Translations load from `/languages` via the plugin header (`Text Domain` + `Domain Path`) — no `load_plugin_textdomain()` in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin`.
- Settings: `edminboost_settings` via `EDMINBOOST_Settings` (group `edminboost_settings_group`). Global kill switch: `enabled`.
- Command Center config lives under `settings['command_center']`; helpers in `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center`.
- Live admin bar: `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center_Bar` (not a feature module) — registered in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`, renders saved `top_bar_items` on `#wpadminbar` and applies behavior declutter toggles. Panel/badge behavior fields (`command_center.behavior` drawer width, badge style, animation speed) edit on Top Bar (`#edminboost-mapper-look`, gated until a link uses drawer interaction); declutter toggles edit on Theme (Appearance).
- Menu Studio: `EDMINBOOST_Menu_Studio` — sidebar reorder/hide/custom links (top-level + submenu), layout/typography (`menu_width`, `font_size`, `line_height`, `letter_spacing`, `display_mode`), and optional menu colors; config under `command_center.menu_studio`; runtime config resolved via `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::resolve_menu_studio_for_user()` (role preset assignments + `merge_saved_custom_menu_items()` to preserve saved custom links + `role_visibility` filtering — submenu slugs hide via `remove_submenu_page()`, top-level via `remove_menu_page()`). Custom slugs via `EDMINBOOST_Menu_Studio::get_custom_menu_slug()`.
- Layout presets configure both the top bar (`top_bar_items`) and sidebar (`menu_studio`); `apply_preset()` and form `_apply_preset` saves replace both via `EDMINBOOST_Settings::sanitize_command_center()` (preset sidebar replaces prior `menu_studio`, does not merge). Saved custom sidebar links are re-merged at runtime when a role preset is assigned. Use Top Bar and Menu Studio for granular overrides.
- Setting help: `EDMINBOOST_Setting_Help` — accessible info-icon tooltips on CC/feature pages and on the Dashboard first-run setup wizard (`should_show()` is false on Dashboard only after `is_setup_complete()`); registry keyed by setting ID; call `echo_icon( $key )` beside labels (checkbox rows: icon before `<input>` inside `.edminboost-checkbox-row`).
- Visual theme: `EDMINBOOST_Theme` — CSS-token presets (20+ skins + Custom, light/dark/auto mode, scheduled dark mode, system fonts, font size, admin favicon/background, post status colors, five color tokens); config under `command_center.theme`; loads on all wp-admin when enabled, plus live CC bar and drawer on the front end.
- White label (premium package, licensed only): `EDMINBOOST_White_Label` in `includes/pro/` — hooks registered via `EDMINBOOST_Plan_Gating::register_pro_runtime_modules()` when `EDMINBOOST_Plan_Licensing::is_active()`. Config under `white_label`; page partials under `admin/partials/pro/`. Dependent sections disable until master toggle is on.
- **Builds:** Dev repo ships both free and premium artifacts. `bin/build-wporg-zip.sh` excludes `includes/pro/`, `admin/partials/pro/`, `admin/js/pro/`, and `admin/css/pro/` (verified by `bin/verify-wporg-zip.sh` — no Freemius SDK). `bin/build-premium-zip.sh` includes `includes/pro/edminboost-premium.php` + bundled Freemius SDK for direct download/licensing.
- **Billing (direct-download build only):** `EDMINBOOST_Admin_Billing` registers the sidebar Billing screen; partial `admin/partials/pro/edminboost-billing-page.php`. Catalog from `EDMINBOOST_Billing::get_plans()` / `get_comparison_rows()`; external CTAs via `EDMINBOOST_Billing::get_upgrade_url()` (`EDMINBOOST_UPGRADE_URL` from premium bootstrap, filter `edminboost_upgrade_url`). Active plan: `EDMINBOOST_Plan_Licensing::get_active_billing_plan()` (filter `edminboost_active_billing_plan`). WordPress.org build has no Billing page and no upgrade URL constant.
- **Plan / Pro split:** **`EDMINBOOST_Plan`** (core, always loaded) — `is_direct_build()` / `is_premium_build()` (`EDMINBOOST_PREMIUM_BUILD`), preset picker filters (`include_preset_in_ui()`, `is_layout_preset_available()`, `is_theme_preset_available()`), licensed UI facade (`has_licensed_admin_ui()`, `allows_custom_preset_actions()`, `render_admin_extension()`, `is_login_redirects_enabled()` — delegate to filters / `EDMINBOOST_Pro` when the premium package is present). **`EDMINBOOST_Plan_Licensing`** (premium) — `is_active()` (filter `edminboost_is_pro_active`), `get_billing_url()`. **`EDMINBOOST_Plan_Limits`** (premium) — `FREE_SCENARIO_PRESETS`, `FREE_THEME_PRESETS`, `enforce_plan_limits()` / `strip_pro_*`. **`EDMINBOOST_Plan_Gating`** (premium) — attaches limit filters on `edminboost_settings`, `edminboost_sanitize_settings`, preset availability filters, and registers White Label when licensed. **`EDMINBOOST_Pro`** (premium) — licensed partial package under `admin/partials/pro/` (`ADMIN_EXTENSION_PARTIALS`, `do_action( 'edminboost_admin_extension' )`). Unlicensed premium matches WordPress.org: Pro fields omitted (not locked). Licensed Pro/Agency: full UI via `has_licensed_admin_ui()`. See `edminboost-compliance.mdc` and `edminboost-command-center.mdc`.
- Feature settings: `EDMINBOOST_Feature_Settings` — centralized `features` defaults, `normalize()`, `is_enabled()`, and `sanitize()`; legacy `admin_bar` / `admin_menu` keys are stripped on read.
- Version tracker: `edminboost_version` (`EDMINBOOST_Settings::VERSION_OPTION`), seeded on activation.
- Features extend `EDMINBOOST_Feature_Base` in `includes/features/`, loaded by `EDMINBOOST_Features`.
- Admin UI: `EDMINBOOST_Admin` + partials in `admin/partials/`. Shared form footer: `edminboost-form-actions.php` (Save + Reset to defaults on CC/feature pages). Plugins screen row meta includes a Docs link (`add_plugin_row_meta()` → `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_DOCS_URL`).
- Feature tab live previews: theme-aware inline `--eb-op-*` vars from `EDMINBOOST_Theme::resolve_preview_colors()`. Productivity: `admin/partials/edminboost-productivity-preview.php` (`$preview`: `admin_notices`|`screen`|`dashboard_widgets`); preview roots `#edminboost-productivity-{notices,screen,dashboard}-preview` synced by `initProductivityFeatures()` (`.edminboost-productivity-preview` markup). Performance: `admin/partials/edminboost-performance-preview.php` (`$preview`: `emoji`|`assets`); `#edminboost-performance-emoji-preview` / `#edminboost-performance-assets-preview` synced by `initPerformanceFeatures()`. Both included from `edminboost-feature-fields.php`. Appearance: `edminboost-declutter-preview.php` (`$behavior`; `#edminboost-declutter-preview`) synced by `initDeclutterPreview()`; `edminboost-theme-extras-preview.php` (`$theme`, `$preview_colors`; `#edminboost-theme-extras-preview`) included from `edminboost-theme-settings.php` and synced by `initThemeExtras()`.
- Plugin-screen assets enqueued via `EDMINBOOST_Admin::is_plugin_screen()`. Visual theme CSS (`edminboost-themes`) loads via `EDMINBOOST_Theme::enqueue_assets()` on all wp-admin when enabled (also as dependency of `edminboost-admin` on plugin screens). CC bar CSS loads when active (`is_active()`) or on Layout Studio (`is_mapper_screen()`). CC bar JS + drawer shell load when `has_drawer_items()` **or** on Layout Studio (mapper drawer preview). Drawer shell also renders on `wp_footer` when the admin bar shows on the front end.
- Privileged AJAX: `wp_ajax_edminboost_cc_drawer_preview` (Layout Studio drawer preview — premium package, `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center_Bar_Pro`); `wp_ajax_edminboost_save_settings` (CC + settings AJAX save, `EDMINBOOST_Admin::ajax_save_settings()` — success payload from `build_ajax_save_response()` includes `presets`, `selected_preset`, `active_layout_preset`, `default_preset`, `theme`, `setup_complete`, `message`); `wp_ajax_edminboost_load_cc_page` (CC tab HTML without full reload, `EDMINBOOST_Admin::ajax_load_cc_page()` — calls `prime_cc_page_context()` / `ensure_discovery_menu_snapshot()` before render; optional `form_defaults=1` renders with `EDMINBOOST_Settings::get_form_defaults()` for form reset without writing options); `wp_ajax_edminboost_export_settings` / `wp_ajax_edminboost_import_settings` (Settings JSON backup — premium package + licensed UI only, `EDMINBOOST_Admin_Licensed` → `EDMINBOOST_Admin::ajax_export_settings()` / `ajax_import_settings()`).
- No custom tables, REST endpoints, cron, or blocks — options API only (WPForms badge count uses a guarded read on `wpforms_entries` when WPForms is present).
- No external requests or telemetry. Badge sources read local WP/WC data only. Billing upgrade links are user-initiated `<a target="_blank">` to the external pricing page only — no checkout API, license validation, or background remote calls.

## Admin Pages

Use `EDMINBOOST_Admin::PAGE_SLUG` (equals `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG`) — never hardcode slug strings. Command Center suffixes: `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::PAGE_*`.

**Sidebar** (`get_page_links()` + `normalize_plugin_submenu()`): Dashboard, Layout Presets, Theme (Appearance slug), Top Bar, Menu Studio; **Billing** when `EDMINBOOST_Plan::is_direct_build()`; **Settings** when `EDMINBOOST_Plan::has_licensed_admin_ui()` (via filter `edminboost_command_center_page_links` from `EDMINBOOST_Admin_Licensed`).

**Tab-only** (registered with `add_submenu_page( null, … )`, reachable via CC sub-nav / `get_nav_items()`): Productivity, Security, Performance; **White Label** + **Settings** appended when licensed (filter `edminboost_command_center_nav_items`). Optional menus also register on action `edminboost_register_admin_menus` (`EDMINBOOST_Admin_Licensed::register_submenus()`).

| Page | Slug | Renderer | Sidebar |
|------|------|----------|---------|
| Dashboard | `PAGE_SLUG` | `render_admin_page()` | yes |
| Layout Presets | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_PRESETS` | `render_presets_page()` | yes |
| Theme (Appearance) | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_APPEARANCE` | `render_appearance_page()` | yes |
| Top Bar | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_MAPPER` | `render_mapper_page()` | yes |
| Menu Studio | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_MENU_STUDIO` | `render_menu_studio_page()` | yes |
| Billing | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_BILLING` | `EDMINBOOST_Admin_Billing::render_page()` (direct-download build only) | yes |
| Productivity | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_PRODUCTIVITY` | `render_productivity_page()` | tab-only |
| Security | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_SECURITY` | `render_security_page()` | tab-only |
| Performance | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_PERFORMANCE` | `render_performance_page()` | tab-only |
| White Label | `PAGE_SLUG . PAGE_WHITE_LABEL` | `render_white_label_page()` → `admin/partials/pro/edminboost-white-label-page.php` | tab-only (licensed) |
| Settings | `PAGE_SLUG . '-settings'` | `render_settings_page()` (backup partial via `EDMINBOOST_Plan::render_admin_extension( 'settings_backup' )`) | yes (licensed) |

Legacy slugs: `-onboarding` redirects to Dashboard; `-behavior` redirects to Appearance (hidden submenu entries, not in sidebar).

`EDMINBOOST_Admin::normalize_plugin_submenu()` (priority 999 on `admin_menu`) keeps Dashboard first under EdminBoost even when Menu Studio reorders plugin submenu items.

Capability: `EDMINBOOST_Settings::CAPABILITY` (`manage_options`).

Settings constants: `OPTION_NAME` (`edminboost_settings`), `SETTINGS_GROUP` (`edminboost_settings_group`), `VERSION_OPTION` (`edminboost_version`).

## Naming

Project prefix: `edminboost` (10 characters). Use consistently for hooks, options, CSS/JS handles, and PHP identifiers — **not** for the translation text domain (that value is the full plugin slug; see Naming table).

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Constants | `EDMINBOOST_*` | `EDMINBOOST_VERSION` |
| Plugin slug | `edminboost-admin-customization` | `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG`, bootstrap filename |
| Text domain | `edminboost-admin-customization` | `EDMINBOOST_TEXT_DOMAIN`, plugin header `Text Domain` (same as `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG`) |
| Classes | `EDMINBOOST_{Name}` | `EDMINBOOST_Admin` |
| Functions | `edminboost_{action}` | `edminboost_run_plugin()` |
| Options | `edminboost_{key}` | `edminboost_settings` |
| Feature IDs | `snake_case` | `hide_admin_notices` |
| CSS/JS handles | `edminboost-{name}` | `edminboost-admin` |
| CSS classes | `edminboost-*` | `edminboost-wrap`, `edminboost-cc-*` |
| JS global (localized) | `edminboostData` / `edminboostCcBar` | plugin screens (`themeSettings`, `presets`, `ccNav`, …) / live CC bar drawer |

Use `EDMINBOOST_TEXT_DOMAIN` for all translations (same string as `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG`).

## Extension Hooks

- `edminboost_feature_classes` — add/remove feature class names before instantiation
- `edminboost_features_loaded` — after features are registered
- `edminboost_settings_defaults`, `edminboost_settings`, `edminboost_sanitize_settings`
- `edminboost_is_feature_enabled` — custom feature enable logic
- `edminboost_is_pro_active` — override Pro/Agency active state (tests, Freemius)
- `edminboost_active_billing_plan` — override active billing plan ID (`free`, `pro`, `agency`)
- `edminboost_upgrade_url` — override external upgrade/pricing page URL for Billing CTAs
- `edminboost_has_licensed_admin_ui` — licensed admin screens/partials (default false; premium package sets true when licensed)
- `edminboost_allows_custom_preset_actions` — save/rename/duplicate custom layout presets
- `edminboost_login_redirects_enabled` — runtime enable for login redirects feature
- `edminboost_include_preset_in_ui`, `edminboost_is_layout_preset_available`, `edminboost_is_theme_preset_available` — preset picker availability
- `edminboost_command_center_merged_settings` — merged CC settings after defaults (plan limits on unlicensed premium)
- `edminboost_command_center_page_links`, `edminboost_command_center_nav_items` — CC nav rows
- `edminboost_register_admin_menus` — premium registers Settings / White Label submenus
- `edminboost_admin_extension` — include licensed partial slot (`EDMINBOOST_Pro::render_admin_extension()`)
- `edminboost_mapper_item_sidebar_partial` — swap Top Bar item config partial path (licensed → `admin/partials/pro/edminboost-mapper-item-sidebar.php`)
- `edminboost_render_cc_page`, `edminboost_cc_page_title` — Billing page render hooks

## Scope & Change Discipline

- Admin-only plugin — no frontend hooks unless explicitly requested.
- Minimize diff scope; match existing file structure and coding style.
- Add `index.php` silence files when creating new directories.
- Update `readme.txt` changelog for user-facing changes.

## Constants (use, don't redefine)

`EDMINBOOST_VERSION`, `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_FILE`, `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_DIR`, `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_URL`, `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_BASENAME`, `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG`, `EDMINBOOST_TEXT_DOMAIN`, `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_DOCS_URL`, `EDMINBOOST_UPGRADE_URL`
